    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d119">

                <pb facs="0345" n="87" xml:id="pg87"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/105</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Denmark</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Egan</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-30T12:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 30, 1915, noon</hi>.</date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>204. Ford party disintegrated, ending in
                    [dissension?]. Mrs. Schwimmer, the
                    leading spirit, has no plan.... No effect upon public opinion here: fiasco.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Minister</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
